        },
        "valueString": "Denies chest pain, palpitations, cough, fevers, calf pain or swelling, pleuritic pain, and haemoptysis. Sleeps on 2 pillows 'just in case'; denies paroxysmal nocturnal dyspnoea. Eating and drinking okay."
